### Test Profile Management Endpoints

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = 

### 1. Login as Admin to get token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@payroll.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 2. Get Current User Profile (GET /api/auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Update Profile (PUT /api/auth/profile)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Admin User Updated"
}

### 4. Change Password (POST /api/auth/change-password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Admin123!",
  "newPassword": "NewAdmin123!"
}

### 5. Login with New Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@payroll.com",
  "password": "NewAdmin123!"
}

### 6. Change Password Back to Original
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "NewAdmin123!",
  "newPassword": "Admin123!"
}